          "column": 4,
          "end_column": 23,
          "symbol": "choose",
          "expression": "def choose(self, x, gate):\n    a = x.sin()\n    b = a.cos()\n    c = b.tanh()\n    d = c.relu()\n    e = d.sin()\n    f = e.cos()\n    g = f.tanh()\n    h = g.relu()\n    if gate:\n        return (h, b)\n    else:\n        return (b, h)"
        }
      ],
